 "what": "The second model pass: three structural changes, each checked against records calibration never saw.",
 "changes": [
  "A loop's compute is the larger of its folds' dependent chain and the rest of its body, not their sum.",
  "A vector loop's compute on a wide region is shared among physical cores, not lanes; a scalar loop, a chain and an irregular access are shared among lanes.",
  "A wide region's streams come from the lane's own core's cache once in as many cores as it engages, and otherwise from the shared level holding the whole working set, not from every core's private cache at once."
 ],
